<title>UK: Broker buys E.Midlands shares for Dominion.</title>
<headline>Broker buys E.Midlands shares for Dominion.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>East Midland Electricity shares were active on Thursday as SBC Warburg offer 670p per share in the market for a 15 percent stake in the regional electricity company on behalf of Dominion Resources, traders said.</p>
<p>Dominion's agreed bid for East Midlands was yesterday cleared by the UK government.</p>
<p>East Midlands shares were up 3p at 664-1/2 by 1220 GMT in volume of 28.6 million shares, making it the most active stock in the UK market.</p>
</text>
